Subject: [PATCH 2723/3799] soh: rename func_80980D74 -> DemoGt_CheckCueParams2

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: switches the params 2 piece to update mode 10 when its cue reaches action 2
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Gt/z_demo_gt.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Gt/z_demo_gt.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Gt/z_demo_gt.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Gt/z_demo_gt.c
